      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "This effect is similar to that of the [`MDLMaterialTextureWrapMode.repeat`](mdlmaterialtexturewrapmode/repeat.md) mode, but inverts the range of fractional texture coordinate values whenever the whole part of a texture coordinate value is odd.",
      "normalizedSource": "This effect is similar to that of the [`MDLMaterialTextureWrapMode.repeat`](mdlmaterialtexturewrapmode/repeat.md) mode, but inverts the range of fractional texture coordinate values whenever the whole part of a texture coordinate value is odd.",
