      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "For example, sampling at a coordinate value of `1.7` or `5.7` returns the texel color for the coordinate value of `0.3` (because `1.0 - 0.7 = 0.3`), and sampling at a coordinate value of `2.7` or `8.7` returns the texel color for the coordinate value of `0.7`.",
